","m_comment":"","m_constraintList":[],"m_isDisabled":false,"m_isOrCondition":false}],"m_description":"🤝 Quickly share your contacts using QR codes.\n\n⭐️ Key features:\n- Launch by shaking the device\n- Works only on the home screen to prevent accidental activation\n- Contact selection menu\n- Share phone number\n- Share WhatsApp\n- Share Telegram\n- Automatically generate and display QR codes\n- QR codes are saved locally for instant access\n- Automatic language detection (multilingual)\n\n⚙️ Macro settings:\n- Run it once and enter your contact information\n- QR codes will be generated automatically\n- Grant storage access if requested\n\n💡 Features:\n- Share contacts in seconds without typing\n- Works with any QR scanner\n- All data is stored locally on your device\n- No Internet connection required after setup","m_descriptionOpen":false,"m_enabled":true,"m_excludeLog":false,"m_headingColor":-11382190,"m_isOrCondition":false,"m_name":"ShakeContacts 🤝","m_triggerList":[{"disableLogging":false,"m_SIGUID":-6707843948175058015,"m_classType":"ShakeDeviceTrigger","m_comment":"","m_constraintList":[],"m_isDisabled":false,"m_isOrCondition":false},{"disableLogging":false,"m_SIGUID":-6468706019911997946,"m_classType":"EmptyTrigger","m_comment":"","m_constraintList":[],"m_isDisabled":false,"m_isOrCondition":false}]},"macroExportVersion":1}